{"overview":"در سرزمینی که جهان‌های سایهٔ قدرتمند بر آن حکمفرما هستند، بیشتر بشریت نابود شده است. برای نجات سیاره‌شان از سرنوشت ناگوار، شش قهرمان شجاع به نبردی خطرناک می‌پردازند… و شکست می‌خورند. اما نوری از امید می‌درخشد وقتی که دزیر، یکی از آخرین جادوگران، ناگهان ۱۳ سال به گذشته بازمی‌گردد! حالا با دانشی از آیندهٔ تاریک، آیا می‌تواند مسیر تاریخ را تغییر دهد و جهان را نجات دهد؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a land dominated by the formidable Shadow Worlds, most of humanity has been destroyed. To rescue their planet from impending doom, six brave heroes fight a perilous battle…and fail. But there’s a glimpse of hope when Desir, one of the last mages, is suddenly sent back in time 13 years! Now armed with knowledge of the grim future, can he alter the course of history and save the world?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2023,"poster":"/nBWVWRvSomkuWN5SbJPVQBmwBdq.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/gTYL5MekDWZXkpX0iCSY2mVBIW8.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","KR"],"cast":[{"name":"寺島拓篤","role":"Desir Herrman (voice)","photo":"/n5uCihb318AzQCT9gieMlI2ueYL.jpg","en":"Takuma Terashima"},{"name":"鈴代紗弓","role":"Romantica Eru (voice)","photo":"/7wEX0bXCs2djnp0dKsCqmMKZpZV.jpg","en":"Sayumi Suzushiro"},{"name":"藤原夏海","role":"Pram Schneider (voice)","photo":"/9B9NICRp2li1SA3VF7vyIAxQ0x9.jpg","en":"Natsumi Fujiwara"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Ajest Kingscrown (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"}],"trailer":"K9Kugj3Lxdw","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/230050/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/230050/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","k